          {
            "Text": "The type of Group. Can be either: STANDARD - Indicates that the Group is a STANDARD type. UNLISTED - Indicated the Group is an UNLISTED type. An UNLISTED Group has 2 restrictions: Members can join if and only if an admin invites them \u0026 the group will not be surfaced in any search results.",
