    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Retrieving Group Definitions",
      "Anchor": "retrieving-group-definitions",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Retrieving Group Definitions"
      ],
      "Text": "You can retrieve one or more group information via group ID using the API requests below. You will get a 403 if you are blocked from a specific group.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Retrieving Group Definitions",
      "Anchor": "retrieving-group-definitions",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Retrieving Group Definitions"
      ],
      "Text": "GET\n\nhttps://api.linkedin.com/v2/groupDefinitions/{group ID}",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Retrieving Group Definitions",
      "Anchor": "retrieving-group-definitions",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Retrieving Group Definitions"
      ],
      "Text": "GET\n\nhttps://api.linkedin.com/v2/groupDefinitions?ids=List({group ID1},{group ID2})",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Retrieving Group Definitions",
      "Anchor": "retrieving-group-definitions",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Retrieving Group Definitions"
      ],
      "Text": "Note : In order to make sample calls above succeed, you need indicate X-RestLi-Protocol-Version:2.0.0 in the request header.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "sample group response",
      "Anchor": "sample-group-response",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Retrieving Group Definitions",
        "sample group response"
      ],
      "Text": "{\n    \u0022created\u0022: {\n        \u0022actor\u0022: \u0022urn:li:person:123ABC\u0022, \n        \u0022time\u0022: 1451016805\n    }, \n    \u0022description\u0022: {\n        \u0022locale\u0022: {\n            \u0022country\u0022: \u0022US  \u0022, \n            \u0022language\u0022: \u0022en\u0022, \n            \u0022variant\u0022: null\n        }, \n        \u0022value\u0022: \u0022To discuss LinkedIn APIs!\u0022\n    }, \n    \u0022id\u0022: 7025949, \n    \u0022lastModified\u0022: {\n        \u0022actor\u0022: \u0022urn:li:person:123ABC\u0022, \n        \u0022time\u0022: 1452001682\n    }, \n    \u0022logoUrn\u0022: \u0022urn:li:digitalmediaAsset:C4E07AQGzgQPFVWqo9w\u0022, \n    \u0022rules\u0022: {\n        \u0022locale\u0022: {\n            \u0022country\u0022: \u0022US  \u0022, \n            \u0022language\u0022: \u0022en\u0022, \n            \u0022variant\u0022: null\n        }, \n        \u0022value\u0022: \u0022Refer to https://developer.linkedin.com/docs\u0022\n    }, \n    \u0022title\u0022: {\n        \u0022locale\u0022: {\n            \u0022country\u0022: \u0022US  \u0022, \n            \u0022language\u0022: \u0022en\u0022, \n            \u0022variant\u0022: null\n        }, \n        \u0022value\u0022: \u0022My Awesome Developer Group\u0022\n    }, \n    \u0022type\u0022: \u0022UNLISTED\u0022\n}",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Updating Group Definitions",
      "Anchor": "updating-group-definitions",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Updating Group Definitions"
      ],
      "Text": "As a group admin, you can edit your group\u0027s title , description , rules , logoUrn and type .",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Updating Group Definitions",
      "Anchor": "updating-group-definitions",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Updating Group Definitions"
      ],
      "Text": "POST\n\nhttps://api.linkedin.com/v2/groupDefinitions/{group ID}",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "request body",
      "Anchor": "request-body",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Updating Group Definitions",
        "request body"
      ],
      "Text": "{\n    \u0022patch\u0022: {\n        \u0022$set\u0022: {\n            \u0022description\u0022: {\n                \u0022locale\u0022: {\n                    \u0022country\u0022: \u0022US  \u0022, \n                    \u0022language\u0022: \u0022en\u0022, \n                    \u0022variant\u0022: null\n                }, \n                \u0022value\u0022: \u0022Updating my group\u0027s description!\u0022\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Deleting Group Definitions",
      "Anchor": "deleting-group-definitions",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Deleting Group Definitions"
      ],
      "Text": "As a group admin, you have the ability to delete your own group(s).",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Deleting Group Definitions",
      "Anchor": "deleting-group-definitions",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Deleting Group Definitions"
      ],
      "Text": "DELETE\n\nhttps://api.linkedin.com/v2/groupDefinitions/{group ID}",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Decoration of groupUrn and logoUrn",
      "Anchor": "decoration-of-groupurn-and-logourn",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Decoration of groupUrn and logoUrn"
      ],
      "Text": "To decorate a groupUrn, you will need specify ~:groupDefinition . See below for an example:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Decoration of groupUrn and logoUrn",
      "Anchor": "decoration-of-groupurn-and-logourn",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Decoration of groupUrn and logoUrn"
      ],
      "Text": "GET\n\nhttps://api.linkedin.com/v2/groupMemberships?q=member\u0026membershipStatuses=MEMBER\u0026member={person URN}\u0026projection=(elements*(group~:groupDefinition))",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Decoration of groupUrn and logoUrn",
      "Anchor": "decoration-of-groupurn-and-logourn",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Decoration of groupUrn and logoUrn"
      ],
      "Text": "To decorate a logoUrn, you will need specify ~:playableStreams . See the here for more information and below for an example:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Decoration of groupUrn and logoUrn",
      "Anchor": "decoration-of-groupurn-and-logourn",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Decoration of groupUrn and logoUrn"
      ],
      "Text": "GET\n\nhttps://api.linkedin.com/v2/groupDefinitions/{ID}?projection=(logoUrn~:playableStreams)",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    }
  ]
}
